⍝ — Splay tree validity after searches (32 nodes; April tree demo:899)
•LOAD 'lib/tree.apl'
put←'∪' splay ⋄ get←'⍎' splay ⋄ rem←'~' splay ⋄ chk←'?' splay ⋄ vec←'∊' splay ⋄ dep←'≡' splay
check←{(1 32≡2↑chk ⍵)∧(⍳32)≡↑¨vec ⍵}
