⍝ — Splay tree search depths and retrieved keys (32 nodes; April tree demo:901)
•LOAD 'lib/tree.apl'
put←'∪' splay ⋄ get←'⍎' splay ⋄ rem←'~' splay ⋄ chk←'?' splay ⋄ vec←'∊' splay ⋄ dep←'≡' splay
